A field the new version removes, that nothing maps or drops, where the new
version is open. The tip admits a before through its ... but does not declare
one, so before is removed all the same, and must be accounted for.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	before:    string
	unchanged: string
	...
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	after:     string
	unchanged: string
	...
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	tip: {
		after: "x"
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: v0.0 declares before and tip does not, and nothing maps it
 --> tip.thema:7:1
  |
7 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write <field>: v0_0.before to move it, or before: _drop
